WEBVTT

01:41.720 --> 01:43.800
What a useless fool she is.

01:44.600 --> 01:46.680
After all my years of careful nurture,

01:46.760 --> 01:49.440
she was actually
pushed to the edge by a young girl.

01:49.520 --> 01:52.680
She even wanted to cut off my arm
and kowtow to apologize to Liu Wencai.

01:52.760 --> 01:54.960
They must have gone mad.

01:58.320 --> 02:00.160
You dare to speak of nurturing us.

02:00.720 --> 02:02.040
Since we were young,

02:02.120 --> 02:04.640
you just treated my sister and me
as tools to gain power.

02:06.080 --> 02:07.600
If not for your careful nurture,

02:09.199 --> 02:10.199
would Shuran

02:11.440 --> 02:13.280
have gone mad?

02:13.760 --> 02:16.080
Do you even see me as your father?

02:16.160 --> 02:18.040
Do you even remember that you're a father?

02:19.520 --> 02:21.960
Then you should do
what a father should do.

02:22.040 --> 02:22.920
What do you mean?

02:23.000 --> 02:25.200
Write a letter to His Majesty
and resign from your position

02:25.280 --> 02:27.600
saying it's your fault
for not teaching your child well

02:27.680 --> 02:29.040
and you're willing to become a monk

02:29.120 --> 02:32.680
to pray for the dead daily
to atone for your sins.

02:32.760 --> 02:34.080
Are you crazy?

02:34.560 --> 02:36.200
Why would I do that?

02:36.280 --> 02:37.760
To save Shuran.

02:37.840 --> 02:38.960
For your sister's sake,

02:39.040 --> 02:41.560
you're willing to abandon your father?

02:41.640 --> 02:43.280
You'll only stay
in the temple temporarily.

02:43.960 --> 02:44.880
After the dust settles,

02:46.160 --> 02:48.560
I'll find a reason to bring you back

02:48.640 --> 02:51.040
and you can continue your luxurious life.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.800
That's easy for you to say.

02:52.880 --> 02:54.480
This incident caused such a commotion.

02:54.560 --> 02:56.560
Who knows how many years
I have to stay at the temple

02:56.640 --> 02:58.200
before things settle down?

03:03.760 --> 03:05.360
If you don't help her,

03:06.640 --> 03:10.120
you'll lose more than just one daughter.

03:11.600 --> 03:12.440
You…

03:23.520 --> 03:26.840
Old Madam, the medicine is ready.

03:27.640 --> 03:29.640
It will be delivered tonight at 7 p.m.

03:32.640 --> 03:33.720
Everything

03:35.520 --> 03:37.200
is my fault.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.760
I thought

03:40.320 --> 03:43.920
I managed the Jiang household well.

03:45.520 --> 03:49.480
But I still let the Ye family fall
into the Ji family's trap.

03:50.040 --> 03:51.360
That poor child died too early.

03:52.880 --> 03:56.240
Leaving Li'er behind
is already pitiful enough.

03:57.440 --> 03:59.040
Yet I didn't believe her.

04:00.960 --> 04:03.080
Claims of matricide and fratricide

04:04.760 --> 04:07.480
were thrown at her,

04:09.760 --> 04:12.320
which filled her with despair
and disappointment.

04:12.400 --> 04:13.760
Now that I think of it,

04:15.400 --> 04:16.959
it was absolutely absurd.

04:17.040 --> 04:19.640
Old Madam, don't blame yourself too much.

04:20.240 --> 04:22.040
Back when Madam Ye was alive,

04:22.120 --> 04:23.360
Madam Ji was still an outsider.

04:24.080 --> 04:26.440
No matter how careful you were,

04:26.520 --> 04:28.120
you couldn't guard against outsiders.

04:28.200 --> 04:30.000
There's no need to comfort me.

04:31.160 --> 04:34.880
A mistake is a mistake.

04:35.680 --> 04:37.640
Old Madam, Ms. Jiang Li
requests to see you.

04:46.000 --> 04:48.920
Li'er, you should get more rest.

04:54.480 --> 04:55.520
Grandmother,

04:57.240 --> 04:58.400
may I know

04:59.280 --> 05:01.880
what will happen to Madam Ji?

05:02.440 --> 05:05.280
Your father and I have discussed it.

05:06.840 --> 05:08.440
We've asked them to prepare the medicine.

05:09.280 --> 05:11.560
It will be given to her later.

05:11.640 --> 05:12.480
All right.

05:14.080 --> 05:15.920
I can go and see her off.

05:17.320 --> 05:20.880
I have a few final words to say to her.

05:20.960 --> 05:22.400
You can go to her

05:23.920 --> 05:25.160
at 7 p.m. tonight.

05:26.320 --> 05:27.600
Thank you, Grandmother.

05:30.960 --> 05:31.880
Li'er.

05:36.360 --> 05:37.360
Li'er.

05:37.920 --> 05:39.320
I've done you wrong.

05:39.400 --> 05:42.320
I know you've been wronged
all these years.

05:43.960 --> 05:47.040
Even though we found the real culprit,

05:47.600 --> 05:49.440
we still can't clear your name.

05:49.520 --> 05:50.800
But don't worry.

05:51.840 --> 05:54.080
If you ever need anything,

05:55.320 --> 05:57.160
the family will do its best to help you

05:57.920 --> 05:59.480
as long as it's within our ability.

06:01.800 --> 06:02.960
It doesn't matter anymore.

06:06.360 --> 06:08.680
Old Madam, Consort Li sent a message.

06:13.800 --> 06:16.200
Today, Duke Ji resigned from his position,

06:16.680 --> 06:18.600
saying that everything Ji Shuran did

06:18.680 --> 06:20.240
was not her intention

06:20.320 --> 06:22.920
and that she was manipulated by others.

06:23.000 --> 06:25.120
But he is aware of the severity
of her sins,

06:25.200 --> 06:27.360
so he decides to become a monk
to pray for forgiveness.

06:28.040 --> 06:31.360
Her Highness pities Madam Ji for being
manipulated and controlled by others.

06:31.920 --> 06:35.160
Though her crimes are severe,
they're understandable,

06:35.240 --> 06:38.640
so she asks Chancellor Jiang
to spare Mrs. Jiang's life.

06:39.320 --> 06:40.360
Chancellor Jiang,

06:40.440 --> 06:43.000
did you not hear my words clearly?

06:43.080 --> 06:44.760
I heard them clearly.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.400
Li'er.

06:56.160 --> 06:57.320
Where are you going?

07:03.960 --> 07:05.360
It's such good news.

07:06.240 --> 07:08.520
I must quickly tell Mother.

07:21.240 --> 07:22.360
Let her go.

07:22.440 --> 07:23.880
We've wronged her.

07:25.440 --> 07:26.520
We did her wrong.

07:31.320 --> 07:32.280
Consort Li,

07:32.360 --> 07:33.560
the message has been delivered.

07:33.640 --> 07:35.440
Chancellor Jiang has agreed.

07:35.520 --> 07:36.760
- You may go.
- Yes.

07:45.440 --> 07:46.360
Jiang Li.

07:57.080 --> 07:58.080
Ji Shuran.

08:01.640 --> 08:05.320
It's time for you to pay for your sins.

08:05.400 --> 08:08.320
Ji Shuran, you got what you deserve.

08:09.120 --> 08:12.120
It's time to pay for Yue'er's life.

08:12.720 --> 08:15.880
Shuran, stop resisting.

08:15.960 --> 08:17.480
Come and join me.

08:18.320 --> 08:19.680
Come and join me.

08:20.160 --> 08:21.600
- Stop resisting.
- No.

08:21.680 --> 08:22.560
Ji Shuran,

08:23.080 --> 08:25.360
it's time for you to pay for your sins.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.400
Pay for my Yue'er's life.

08:27.480 --> 08:28.640
Come and join me.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.040
- No.
- I've waited for you for so long.

08:30.120 --> 08:31.800
Ji Shuran,
it's time for you to pay for your sins.

08:31.880 --> 08:33.200
- Pay for my Yue'er's life.
- Come and join me.

08:33.280 --> 08:34.840
You got what you deserve.

08:34.919 --> 08:36.880
- Come and join me.
- Pay for my Yue'er's life.

08:48.280 --> 08:49.320
What are you doing here?

08:50.400 --> 08:51.880
I'm here to see you off.

09:01.960 --> 09:03.320
Don't try to scare me.

09:05.760 --> 09:07.480
I am the matron of the Jiang family.

09:07.560 --> 09:09.840
My son, Jiang Bingji,
is Chancellor Jiang's eldest son.

09:10.360 --> 09:13.080
My sister is His Majesty's
favorite consort.

09:14.720 --> 09:15.920
I still have the Ji family.

09:16.840 --> 09:18.200
You can't do anything to me.

09:18.280 --> 09:19.920
Matron of the Jiang family?

09:22.320 --> 09:23.560
Have you forgotten

09:24.440 --> 09:26.320
how you got your position

09:26.400 --> 09:28.000
in the first place?

09:28.080 --> 09:29.280
What are you trying to say?

09:29.360 --> 09:30.840
Concubine Hu told me everything.

09:31.600 --> 09:33.440
I heard Ji Shuran telling Ms. Sun

09:34.440 --> 09:36.120
that the physician who treated Madam Ye

09:36.200 --> 09:37.360
had returned to the capital

09:37.440 --> 09:38.920
and needed to be silenced.

09:39.000 --> 09:39.960
Silenced?

09:42.240 --> 09:44.840
Are you saying my mother didn't die
from being weak

09:44.920 --> 09:46.280
after giving birth to me?

09:46.360 --> 09:48.960
Even if she was weak,
she could still recuperate slowly.

09:49.960 --> 09:51.440
By the end of her postpartum care,

09:51.520 --> 09:54.160
her health was improving.

09:54.840 --> 09:56.760
Then suddenly, her condition worsened

09:56.840 --> 09:58.200
and she didn't last six months.

09:59.360 --> 10:00.400
Thinking back,

10:01.000 --> 10:03.840
it's possible that Ji Shuran bribed
the physician who treated Madam Ye

10:04.400 --> 10:06.320
to tamper with her medicine.

10:07.680 --> 10:09.360
That wretched woman.

10:10.360 --> 10:12.040
Despite being mad, she even slandered me.

10:12.920 --> 10:14.920
My husband would never believe her words.

10:16.080 --> 10:18.400
Once I get out of here,
I'll teach her a lesson.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.160
If you want,

10:21.280 --> 10:22.520
I can send you to meet her.

10:23.960 --> 10:24.800
What?

10:25.360 --> 10:28.680
Concubine Hu went to reunite
with her daughter.

10:29.720 --> 10:32.080
Before leaving, she left me a letter

10:32.640 --> 10:34.760
accusing you of poisoning my mother.

10:35.440 --> 10:36.280
Do you want

10:36.360 --> 10:38.480
to go to hell to settle this with her?

10:48.000 --> 10:50.360
Guards! I want to see Chancellor Jiang!

10:50.440 --> 10:51.480
Open this door!

10:51.560 --> 10:52.640
No use shouting for help.

10:53.680 --> 10:54.520
Ji Shuran,

10:55.000 --> 10:57.920
Grandmother and Father used
to care for you

10:58.440 --> 11:00.840
because you lost a child.

11:00.920 --> 11:02.560
But now, it's clear

11:03.840 --> 11:04.760
that your misery

11:05.440 --> 11:07.520
was all part of a plot you orchestrated.

11:09.440 --> 11:10.280
You're also aware

11:12.160 --> 11:14.760
that sacrificing lives
lets you earn trust.

11:15.320 --> 11:18.000
Now, your retribution has arrived.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.200
Those who died unjustly

11:20.000 --> 11:21.120
can't accept it.

11:21.600 --> 11:22.680
They want to seek justice.

11:23.160 --> 11:25.040
Even in death, they won't let you off.

11:25.120 --> 11:26.760
You can't beat them, Ji Shuran.

11:27.600 --> 11:28.600
Remember this.

11:29.200 --> 11:30.560
Starting today,

11:31.240 --> 11:33.760
no one in the Jiang family
will believe you again.

11:33.840 --> 11:34.680
Jiang Li,

11:35.520 --> 11:37.040
even if I die, I won't let you off.

11:37.120 --> 11:39.000
I won't let you off even after I die.

11:39.920 --> 11:41.160
Fine, go and find her then.

11:42.120 --> 11:44.000
When you meet Jiang Li in the underworld,

11:44.880 --> 11:46.480
she'll be the first to come after you.

11:47.040 --> 11:49.640
What did you say?

11:51.440 --> 11:52.280
You…

11:55.200 --> 11:56.160
You're not Jiang Li.

11:57.560 --> 11:58.560
Do you know

11:59.200 --> 12:00.680
how much Jiang Li suffered

12:02.280 --> 12:05.000
in Zhennv Hall in the past ten years?

12:05.640 --> 12:07.760
She was supposed to be a carefree daughter

12:07.840 --> 12:10.000
of a noble family
who was doted on by her father.

12:10.080 --> 12:11.200
But what happened?

12:13.960 --> 12:17.000
It wasn't enough
for you to kill her mother.

12:17.960 --> 12:19.640
You also tarnished her reputation

12:20.120 --> 12:21.480
and sent her away.

12:22.040 --> 12:23.960
You handed her over to those people,

12:24.760 --> 12:26.680
letting them torture her to death.

12:26.760 --> 12:28.840
They tortured her to death, Ji Shuran!

12:29.600 --> 12:31.240
Can you even imagine
how much she suffered?

12:31.320 --> 12:32.480
Can you?

12:32.560 --> 12:34.000
Do you deserve forgiveness?

12:35.760 --> 12:38.920
I was also forced.

12:40.040 --> 12:41.800
I had no choice either.

12:43.640 --> 12:45.600
I didn't have a choice.

12:47.400 --> 12:49.320
It has been ten years, Ji Shuran.

12:51.680 --> 12:53.520
You had countless chances

12:54.360 --> 12:57.360
to save her and yourself.

12:58.160 --> 13:00.000
But you did nothing.

13:00.640 --> 13:02.600
You only have yourself to blame

13:03.960 --> 13:05.480
for ending up like this.

13:06.840 --> 13:08.080
From now on,

13:08.160 --> 13:09.520
you must reflect on your evil deeds

13:10.240 --> 13:13.080
every day of your life.

13:13.640 --> 13:15.160
I was forced too.

13:18.520 --> 13:20.880
I was forced to do it.

13:22.440 --> 13:23.280
Li'er.

13:28.240 --> 13:30.840
Li'er, I was forced.

13:33.920 --> 13:35.000
Li'er.

13:35.880 --> 13:37.040
Li'er.

13:51.520 --> 13:53.760
I was forced to do it.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.440
Ms. Ruoyao, be careful.

14:19.520 --> 14:20.360
Ms. Ruoyao.

14:21.880 --> 14:24.040
- Ms. Ruoyao, you're not well.
- I want to see my mother.

14:25.240 --> 14:28.600
Ms. Ruoyao, you must get proper rest now.

14:28.680 --> 14:30.920
- I want to see my mother.
- Ms. Ruoyao.

14:31.440 --> 14:32.600
Madam Ji will be fine.

14:32.680 --> 14:34.240
Consort Li already gave instructions,

14:34.320 --> 14:35.520
so no one will harm her.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.480
I only want to know

14:39.680 --> 14:41.760
if she felt even a bit

14:43.080 --> 14:45.760
of reluctance and pity
when she fed me poison.

15:27.960 --> 15:29.480
How is she now?

15:30.760 --> 15:31.600
She has gone mad.

15:36.320 --> 15:37.440
Do you feel for her, Father?

15:39.200 --> 15:41.920
What do you plan to do with her?

15:42.640 --> 15:43.880
Since she has gone mad,

15:45.840 --> 15:47.240
let her guard the tomb.

15:49.040 --> 15:50.480
So she will know

15:51.800 --> 15:53.560
what Concubine Hu had gone through.

16:00.200 --> 16:01.080
Li'er,

16:04.080 --> 16:05.840
do you hate me?

16:08.560 --> 16:09.680
I didn't know

16:10.400 --> 16:13.160
she was this vicious.

16:15.600 --> 16:16.440
Back then,

16:17.560 --> 16:22.120
when your mother's condition
worsened day by day,

16:22.840 --> 16:25.440
I thought she was just in poor health.

16:27.160 --> 16:30.880
I never thought someone harmed her.

16:32.280 --> 16:33.520
If I had known,

16:34.760 --> 16:36.480
I would never have let Ji Shuran

16:36.560 --> 16:38.280
set foot in Jiang Residence.

16:43.120 --> 16:46.440
And I shouldn't have accused you
of matricide and fratricide,

16:46.920 --> 16:49.200
neglected you for ten years,

16:50.360 --> 16:51.200
and

16:52.240 --> 16:54.480
almost caused you to lose your life.

16:55.080 --> 16:58.440
Li'er, do you still resent me

16:59.200 --> 17:01.200
for the exorcism?

17:02.200 --> 17:03.200
I don't hate you.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.280
I've forgiven you.

17:11.760 --> 17:12.640
Li'er.

17:14.760 --> 17:15.800
Father.

17:17.079 --> 17:17.920
If you want to hear

17:19.040 --> 17:19.880
such words,

17:22.440 --> 17:23.800
I can say them to you.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.320
But do you think

17:31.600 --> 17:32.520
I can forgive you?

17:35.120 --> 17:36.840
You can never imagine

17:36.920 --> 17:38.920
what I went through in Zhennv Hall.

17:42.000 --> 17:44.400
Over those ten years,
I had to fetch water, cook,

17:44.480 --> 17:45.640
do laundry, and mend clothes.

17:46.960 --> 17:49.160
I endured hunger and cold weather,

17:49.240 --> 17:50.080
fell on the ground,

17:52.080 --> 17:54.360
and was looked down on.

17:56.480 --> 17:58.520
Every day, I hoped
for my family to come and fetch me

17:58.600 --> 18:00.000
or just send a letter.

18:00.640 --> 18:01.920
But there was nothing.

18:03.480 --> 18:04.880
Absolutely nothing.

18:06.760 --> 18:08.560
So I gradually lost hope.

18:08.640 --> 18:09.680
KIND AND MORAL REPUTATION

18:09.760 --> 18:12.360
I felt completely abandoned.

18:16.280 --> 18:17.840
I wanted to return to the Jiang family

18:18.640 --> 18:20.360
and tried hard to make it happen.

18:21.240 --> 18:23.000
But even that wish

18:24.560 --> 18:25.920
couldn't be fulfilled.

18:34.520 --> 18:35.360
Miss.

18:47.440 --> 18:48.280
Father,

18:51.120 --> 18:52.480
why don't you tell me?

18:53.600 --> 18:54.760
Tell me

18:55.560 --> 18:57.600
how to recover from the scars

18:59.000 --> 19:00.560
these ten years have left on me.

19:02.160 --> 19:03.760
Only the wounds heal.

19:04.680 --> 19:06.680
But scars will always be there.

19:07.480 --> 19:11.640
One's actions lead to consequences,
resulting in family discord.

19:13.040 --> 19:14.080
Your Li'er

19:14.960 --> 19:16.440
can't come back anymore.

19:35.640 --> 19:36.480
You…

19:37.680 --> 19:39.480
You're not attending
the imperial court session anymore?

19:43.920 --> 19:47.800
Ruoyao has been making a ruckus
about seeing her mother.

19:47.880 --> 19:50.480
I want to take her away
from the capital for a few days

19:51.360 --> 19:52.320
to ease her mind.

19:53.240 --> 19:55.400
What about Li'er?

19:55.480 --> 19:56.720
As she wishes,

19:58.000 --> 20:00.800
Ji Shuran will guard the tomb.

20:01.440 --> 20:03.120
Won't you stay in the capital?

20:04.880 --> 20:09.360
Now is the best time for you and Li'er
to mend your relationship…

20:09.440 --> 20:13.200
Mother, maybe distancing myself a bit

20:14.200 --> 20:16.280
and not interfering with Li'er's affairs

20:17.560 --> 20:19.520
is what she truly wants.

20:20.760 --> 20:21.920
Fine.

20:26.560 --> 20:29.520
Congratulations on your great victory,
Your Highness!

20:31.520 --> 20:35.080
You have achieved a lot
in this expedition.

20:35.640 --> 20:38.040
We'll have a hearty celebration tonight!

20:38.120 --> 20:40.040
- Prince Cheng!
- Prince Cheng!

20:40.120 --> 20:41.400
Come on!

20:47.840 --> 20:49.520
- All right. You may go.
- Yes.

21:05.800 --> 21:06.640
My sister

21:08.000 --> 21:09.280
is useless.

21:09.360 --> 21:11.080
Although we lost
the Imperial Diviner Office,

21:11.600 --> 21:12.880
there were unexpected gains.

21:13.560 --> 21:14.560
The Ji family has fallen

21:14.640 --> 21:16.560
and the Jiang family
has paid a heavy price.

21:16.640 --> 21:18.080
Jiang Yuanbai was devastated

21:18.160 --> 21:19.760
and took a leave from the imperial court.

21:19.840 --> 21:22.240
That means our people are dominating

21:23.280 --> 21:25.120
my brother's imperial court now.

21:27.600 --> 21:28.640
Since there's nothing else,

21:29.160 --> 21:30.000
let's adjourn.

21:30.920 --> 21:31.800
Your Majesty,

21:32.520 --> 21:33.760
Prince Cheng

21:33.840 --> 21:35.920
reclaimed another territory in the north.

21:36.000 --> 21:37.680
The Emperor of Dai has retreated over 5 km

21:37.760 --> 21:39.280
beyond the northern border.

21:39.360 --> 21:41.320
The people on the northern border
are also settled.

21:41.400 --> 21:43.480
Such great news is worthy of celebration.

21:43.560 --> 21:45.240
We should reward Prince Cheng

21:45.320 --> 21:47.960
to boost the soldiers' morale
who serve the nation and the people.

21:48.960 --> 21:52.480
How should I reward him, Minister Li?

21:52.560 --> 21:53.840
Even if Dai retreated,

21:54.560 --> 21:56.680
they still harbor
ill intentions toward us.

21:56.760 --> 21:59.040
We should increase Prince Cheng's troops

21:59.120 --> 22:00.720
to fortify our northern borders

22:00.800 --> 22:02.040
and deter Dai.

22:02.520 --> 22:04.080
What do all of you think?

22:04.160 --> 22:05.600
I second the motion.

22:05.680 --> 22:08.360
- I second the motion.
- I second the motion.

22:09.640 --> 22:14.160
- I second the motion.
- I second the motion.

22:20.360 --> 22:21.600
Such a hateful play!

22:24.920 --> 22:27.240
Those ministers have become
Prince Cheng's supporters.

22:27.320 --> 22:28.520
With Jiang Yuanbai absent,

22:28.600 --> 22:30.080
only Li Zhongnan's supporters remain.

22:30.160 --> 22:31.400
Your Majesty, don't be anxious.

22:31.480 --> 22:33.000
Prince Cheng's impressive
military achievements

22:33.080 --> 22:35.160
inevitably make the imperial court wary.

22:35.640 --> 22:37.600
Your Majesty, you must not lose
your composure now

22:37.680 --> 22:39.080
and cause unrest among the people.

22:39.160 --> 22:40.520
I am well aware of this.

22:40.600 --> 22:42.000
But it's hard not to be angry.

22:42.080 --> 22:43.840
Prince Cheng has his own plans.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.600
But we have our own plans as well.

22:45.680 --> 22:47.200
I just received intelligence

22:47.280 --> 22:49.960
that the internal strife in Great Zhao
is about to end.

22:50.520 --> 22:52.480
Has the prince
of Great Zhao taken control?

22:52.560 --> 22:53.440
Yes.

22:53.520 --> 22:55.480
The situation in Great Zhao
just stabilized.

22:55.560 --> 22:57.040
The prince of Great Zhao

22:57.120 --> 22:58.680
has successfully ascended to the throne.

22:58.760 --> 23:01.440
What he needs the most now
is a reliable ally

23:01.520 --> 23:03.160
to prevent the remnants
of the rebel forces

23:03.240 --> 23:04.800
from rising again.

23:04.880 --> 23:07.360
If we have such an ally in the south,

23:07.440 --> 23:09.200
the additional troops Prince Cheng has

23:09.680 --> 23:11.120
are thus insignificant.

23:11.200 --> 23:14.480
How do you know he will ally with us?

23:14.560 --> 23:17.480
The emperor of Great Zhao
is young and has no heirs.

23:17.560 --> 23:18.760
He only has a younger sister.

23:18.840 --> 23:21.320
She fled to our nation
during their internal strife

23:21.400 --> 23:22.880
and I saved her in the south.

23:22.960 --> 23:24.480
She has been here since then.

23:24.560 --> 23:25.960
Did you plan ahead?

23:28.360 --> 23:29.240
Good.

23:29.320 --> 23:31.280
We'll congratulate
the new emperor of Great Zhao

23:31.360 --> 23:32.960
and invite their delegation here

23:33.040 --> 23:34.560
to discuss forming an alliance.

23:34.640 --> 23:36.680
This must be done grandly

23:36.760 --> 23:39.520
to show everyone our bond with Great Zhao.

23:39.600 --> 23:41.600
All right, I'm on it now.

23:42.920 --> 23:43.760
By the way,

23:44.360 --> 23:45.520
such an important event

23:45.600 --> 23:47.680
was usually done
by the Chief Secretariat Jiang Yuanbai

23:47.760 --> 23:50.040
with the Ministry of Rites
and Court of State Ceremonial.

23:50.120 --> 23:51.240
With him on leave

23:51.880 --> 23:54.400
and the Minister of Rites
promoted by Li Zhongnan,

23:55.040 --> 23:57.400
the alliance meeting
might have issues if we fully trust them.

23:57.480 --> 23:59.080
Do you have a suitable candidate in mind?

23:59.160 --> 24:00.960
Since you asked,

24:01.040 --> 24:03.320
you must have someone in mind already.

24:04.280 --> 24:06.880
What do you think of Shen Yurong?

24:06.960 --> 24:08.000
He is quite talented.

24:09.080 --> 24:10.960
But you must be aware of his background.

24:11.560 --> 24:12.840
Do you think

24:13.360 --> 24:15.200
your pawn will give up

24:15.280 --> 24:17.920
the chance
to approach Shen Yurong this time?

24:18.680 --> 24:20.560
Are you going to put that pawn

24:21.120 --> 24:22.280
in danger?

24:22.360 --> 24:24.120
Are you worried she will be in danger?

24:24.200 --> 24:26.800
If a pawn enters a perilous situation,

24:26.880 --> 24:29.040
it will become useless to us.

24:31.080 --> 24:32.520
In the past,

24:32.600 --> 24:34.440
you were the most ruthless at Go.

24:35.360 --> 24:37.320
You taught me to sacrifice one piece

24:37.400 --> 24:38.760
to save the game.

24:39.720 --> 24:42.160
Why do you hesitate now?

24:42.240 --> 24:43.640
I just want to fully utilize her.

24:43.720 --> 24:45.080
Xiao Heng,

24:46.880 --> 24:48.680
are you getting emotionally involved?

24:48.760 --> 24:49.600
I am not.

24:58.080 --> 24:59.560
You'd better not be.

25:13.000 --> 25:14.400
Have you found Situ Jiuyue yet?

25:14.480 --> 25:16.240
My lord, why do you insist on finding her?

25:16.320 --> 25:18.120
Last time, she got angry with you
for no reason

25:18.200 --> 25:20.440
and took all our liquor
in the Duke Mansion.

25:20.520 --> 25:22.680
My lord, I mean
Situ Jiuyue likes to disappear

25:22.760 --> 25:24.560
into the deep mountains and forests.

25:24.640 --> 25:26.800
She won't come out
for ten days or even half a month

25:26.880 --> 25:28.680
unless she finds
the medicinal herbs she wants.

25:28.760 --> 25:30.000
Send more people.

25:30.080 --> 25:32.440
We must find her
before the Great Zhao delegation arrives.

25:32.520 --> 25:33.720
Yes.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.000
Your Highness,

25:38.760 --> 25:40.000
our agents recieved information

25:40.480 --> 25:42.920
that Great Zhao is sending
their delegation here.

25:43.000 --> 25:44.440
Great Zhao accepted the invitation.

25:44.520 --> 25:45.960
In the two nations' alliance meeting,

25:46.040 --> 25:48.040
Great Zhao's emperor
will personally lead the delegation.

25:49.560 --> 25:51.600
Great Zhao becoming close to Great Yan

25:51.680 --> 25:53.200
is a variable for us.

25:54.480 --> 25:55.680
Any countermeasures?

25:55.760 --> 25:57.120
The alliance is not unexpected.

25:57.800 --> 25:59.160
But they're coming here too soon.

25:59.920 --> 26:00.760
What do you mean?

26:01.240 --> 26:03.840
During the internal strife in Great Zhao,
their princess fled here.

26:04.600 --> 26:06.200
The main purpose of the emperor

26:06.280 --> 26:07.400
coming personally is

26:07.480 --> 26:08.560
to bring the princess back.

26:09.680 --> 26:12.120
Zhao Ye has probably
already found this princess.

26:12.200 --> 26:15.440
That's why their emperor is coming quickly
with the delegation in person.

26:15.520 --> 26:18.080
Its success and failure
depend on the same person.

26:19.040 --> 26:21.000
If the princess of Great Zhao dies

26:21.080 --> 26:22.760
in Great Yan,

26:24.160 --> 26:27.360
that brother of mine
will be attacked on all sides.

26:29.160 --> 26:31.360
Go and keep a close watch on Xiao Heng.

26:31.440 --> 26:33.440
Investigate everyone
he comes into contact with.

26:34.560 --> 26:35.400
Yes.

26:43.400 --> 26:45.360
Mr. Shen, you've completed
the book compilation.

26:45.440 --> 26:47.840
This time, you are also
in charge of welcoming the delegation,

26:47.920 --> 26:50.040
which shows
His Majesty's deep trust in you.

26:50.120 --> 26:51.880
Your future is indeed bright.

26:51.960 --> 26:54.280
This is indeed worth celebrating.

26:54.360 --> 26:56.600
My son isn't very talented
but has some musical knowledge.

26:56.680 --> 26:59.800
Can he perform the flute at the banquet

26:59.880 --> 27:01.880
for the alliance meeting
between the two nations?

27:01.960 --> 27:04.360
I am merely doing my duty
for the imperial court.

27:04.840 --> 27:06.520
I cannot be compared to you all.

27:06.600 --> 27:08.680
As for the talents needed
to receive the delegation,

27:08.760 --> 27:10.520
I'll compile them
based on the specifications

27:10.600 --> 27:11.680
of the Ministry of Rites

27:11.760 --> 27:13.080
and arrange them accordingly.

27:13.560 --> 27:15.440
Those who wish to contribute

27:15.520 --> 27:17.560
are welcome to submit their names.

27:17.640 --> 27:20.160
Thank you in advance then, Mr. Shen.

27:21.560 --> 27:23.080
- We'll take our leave.
- We'll get going.

27:23.160 --> 27:24.080
I'll take my leave now.

27:25.640 --> 27:26.760
Mr. Shen,

27:26.840 --> 27:29.440
the arrangements for
the grand alliance meeting are extensive.

27:29.920 --> 27:30.920
Do take care of yourself.

27:31.480 --> 27:32.440
If you need anything,

27:32.520 --> 27:34.280
I will do my best to help.

27:34.360 --> 27:35.360
Thank you.

27:44.200 --> 27:45.040
YE RESIDENCE

27:45.120 --> 27:46.160
Eat more.

27:47.080 --> 27:47.920
Eat more.

27:48.400 --> 27:49.280
Eating.

27:49.360 --> 27:50.480
All you do is eat.

27:50.560 --> 27:51.920
Jiang Li is already so thin.

27:52.000 --> 27:53.920
As her cousin,
can't you talk some sense into her?

27:54.000 --> 27:56.360
You know what Li'er's temper is like.

27:56.440 --> 27:58.520
Besides, I'm not her only cousin.

27:59.240 --> 28:00.560
Why aren't you scolding Ye Shijie?

28:03.800 --> 28:06.680
The imperial court is selecting reception
envoys for the Great Zhao delegation

28:06.760 --> 28:08.680
who will perform at the alliance banquet.

28:09.560 --> 28:12.120
With Li'er's qualifications,
she will surely be chosen.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.760
Maybe finding something for her to do

28:14.240 --> 28:15.600
will make her feel better.

28:16.400 --> 28:18.480
I wonder if she's willing to participate.

28:18.560 --> 28:20.400
I'll be counting on both of you

28:20.480 --> 28:21.600
to persuade her then.

28:29.560 --> 28:31.360
Let's eat together.

28:35.960 --> 28:37.600
What did you say?

28:37.680 --> 28:39.440
He said he wants you to join him.

28:43.200 --> 28:44.560
Here, eat up.

28:45.040 --> 28:45.880
All right.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.280
Everything will be fine.

28:52.560 --> 28:53.400
Li'er.

28:55.840 --> 28:57.920
The Great Zhao delegation
will arrive in a few days.

28:58.000 --> 29:00.160
The imperial court
is selecting reception envoys.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.480
Are you interested in joining?

29:02.080 --> 29:03.760
I just heard Jingrui and Liu Xu say

29:04.360 --> 29:05.680
they will participate.

29:05.760 --> 29:06.680
If we are chosen,

29:06.760 --> 29:07.960
our team can be together again.

29:10.200 --> 29:13.240
No, I just want to rest for now.

29:13.320 --> 29:14.160
After this, you…

29:19.120 --> 29:21.240
Liu Xu, and Jiang Jingrui

29:21.760 --> 29:23.040
shouldn't come and see me again.

29:23.560 --> 29:24.400
I want some peace.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.120
Xue Zhao.

29:43.480 --> 29:46.840
Father can eat and drink normally now.

29:48.320 --> 29:50.960
Although he still doesn't remember us now,

29:51.720 --> 29:53.200
as long as he's alive,

29:54.440 --> 29:55.920
there's hope.

30:00.520 --> 30:02.360
TOMB OF XUE ZHAO

30:02.440 --> 30:06.280
When I first came to the capital,
I was alone.

30:06.840 --> 30:10.600
But now, I have Father

30:14.160 --> 30:16.520
and friends
who went through thick and thin with me.

30:19.240 --> 30:20.200
Xue Zhao,

30:21.280 --> 30:23.360
I am very fortunate, right?

30:26.960 --> 30:27.880
But I

30:31.920 --> 30:33.360
would rather be alone.

30:37.040 --> 30:38.080
That way,

30:39.360 --> 30:41.520
no one would be dragged down
because of me.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.320
Tong'er…

31:23.520 --> 31:25.400
Zhao Ke brought back the person

31:25.480 --> 31:26.360
you asked him to find.

31:31.760 --> 31:33.560
She doesn't trust people at all.

31:33.640 --> 31:35.880
Be careful when you see her later.

32:41.640 --> 32:42.600
Haitang.

32:46.520 --> 32:47.440
Haitang.

32:55.040 --> 32:55.880
Haitang,

32:56.640 --> 32:57.680
it's me.

33:01.120 --> 33:02.200
Haitang, it's me.

33:02.680 --> 33:03.680
Don't be afraid.

33:04.640 --> 33:05.600
Don't touch me!

33:06.360 --> 33:07.400
Don't touch me.

33:07.480 --> 33:09.040
Don't touch me.

33:09.120 --> 33:10.440
It's me, Haitang.

33:11.120 --> 33:11.960
It's me.

33:15.840 --> 33:17.360
I'm Xue Fangfei.

33:20.920 --> 33:21.760
Haitang.

33:24.520 --> 33:25.640
My lady.

33:26.120 --> 33:26.960
It's me.

33:34.680 --> 33:35.720
You're still alive.

33:36.240 --> 33:37.240
I'm still alive.

33:39.640 --> 33:40.680
Let me take a look at you.

33:51.280 --> 33:52.480
What happened to your face?

33:53.280 --> 33:54.960
It's nothing.

34:00.760 --> 34:02.160
I thought

34:02.240 --> 34:04.840
I would never see you again.

34:13.080 --> 34:13.920
I'm sorry.

34:15.480 --> 34:16.960
It's my fault.

34:17.040 --> 34:18.280
I should have…

34:18.360 --> 34:20.480
I should have taken you with me back then.

34:20.560 --> 34:21.639
I'm sorry.

34:36.120 --> 34:38.280
What happened after you left?

34:44.560 --> 34:46.440
After I delivered the message
to Mr. Xue Zhao,

34:47.320 --> 34:49.560
someone put a sack over my head
and knocked me unconscious.

34:50.960 --> 34:52.040
Come on. Throw her here.

34:56.679 --> 34:57.520
Let's go.

34:58.520 --> 35:00.640
When I finally regained consciousness,

35:00.720 --> 35:02.400
I was already in a mass grave.

35:03.240 --> 35:05.240
They left probably because they thought

35:05.320 --> 35:06.160
I was dead.

35:07.680 --> 35:09.680
After escaping death,
I didn't dare to be seen

35:09.760 --> 35:11.160
or go back to my hometown.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.240
I was afraid they would catch me.

35:14.320 --> 35:16.080
So I wandered in the neighboring county

35:16.640 --> 35:17.760
for a few months,

35:18.720 --> 35:20.640
eating leftover food daily.

35:21.480 --> 35:22.720
After a few months,

35:23.440 --> 35:25.920
I returned to my hometown
and saw my younger brother.

35:27.000 --> 35:30.960
After asking around, I learned
about what happened to the Xue family.

35:35.160 --> 35:36.080
Haitang,

35:37.560 --> 35:38.520
you've suffered.

35:39.120 --> 35:40.640
I'm sorry.

35:41.760 --> 35:43.760
My lady, don't be sorry.

35:43.840 --> 35:46.360
Those who harmed us
are the ones who should be sorry.

35:46.440 --> 35:48.320
I should have fought
the Shen family back then.

35:48.880 --> 35:50.160
I only want you to live well.

35:51.080 --> 35:53.440
I just want you to live on.

35:56.400 --> 35:57.280
Get proper rest here.

35:58.000 --> 35:59.560
I'll have someone take good care of you.

36:11.880 --> 36:12.720
Duke Su,

36:13.200 --> 36:14.240
I have a favor to ask.

36:18.240 --> 36:19.920
Is it about the scar on her face?

36:20.520 --> 36:21.360
Yes.

36:22.440 --> 36:23.960
If Jiuyue comes to you,

36:24.040 --> 36:25.440
please inform me.

36:25.520 --> 36:27.680
I want to ask Jiuyue
to treat Magistrate Xue and Haitang.

36:27.760 --> 36:30.040
You know she uses poison.

36:30.120 --> 36:31.760
You're risking their lives for survival.

36:31.840 --> 36:32.760
I trust her.

36:32.840 --> 36:34.920
I'll send someone to notify you
when I find her.

36:41.640 --> 36:42.480
Duke Su.

36:43.040 --> 36:43.960
After you.

36:44.040 --> 36:45.040
Do you know

36:45.120 --> 36:47.600
how to truly protect someone?

36:47.680 --> 36:49.600
Don't push the person
you want to protect away

36:49.680 --> 36:50.760
from you.

36:50.840 --> 36:52.360
Keep her close

36:52.440 --> 36:54.400
within your sight.

36:54.480 --> 36:55.720
Is that how you do it?

36:57.800 --> 36:58.760
I don't need to do that.

36:58.840 --> 37:00.640
Duke Su, you just can't
get rid of the habit

37:00.720 --> 37:02.080
of eavesdropping on people.

37:04.440 --> 37:06.640
It's because you were speaking so loudly.

37:06.720 --> 37:08.680
So it's my fault.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.800
At least you know your mistake.

37:12.680 --> 37:15.840
Are you going to the reception envoy
selection for the Great Zhao delegation?

37:15.920 --> 37:17.400
Why do you want me to participate too?

37:17.480 --> 37:19.840
Shen Yurong is in charge of this.

37:25.960 --> 37:26.840
Duke Su,

37:27.840 --> 37:29.440
you once told me

37:29.520 --> 37:31.040
the story of Duke Huang of the East Sea.

37:31.680 --> 37:33.200
Today, let me tell you

37:33.280 --> 37:34.800
the story of A Beauty's Return.

37:40.040 --> 37:42.000
A gentleman became infatuated

37:42.080 --> 37:44.200
with a beautiful lady during his travels

37:44.280 --> 37:45.440
and promised to marry her.

37:46.640 --> 37:48.080
However,

37:48.160 --> 37:49.920
he abandoned her
and returned to the capital.

37:50.600 --> 37:54.240
By order of his parents, he married
a noble family's legitimate daughter.

37:54.320 --> 37:55.760
Little did he know,

37:55.840 --> 37:58.240
this woman bore a striking resemblance
to the abandoned lady,

37:58.320 --> 38:00.960
not just in looks but also in mannerisms.

38:01.600 --> 38:02.680
The gentleman was convinced

38:02.760 --> 38:05.720
that the noble family refused to marry
their real legitimate daughter to him,

38:05.800 --> 38:07.360
so they found a substitute bride.

38:09.160 --> 38:12.280
And ironically, the substitute bride
was the abandoned lady.

38:12.960 --> 38:15.080
Throughout their marriage,

38:15.160 --> 38:17.760
the gentleman was consumed
with proving his suspicions.

38:18.760 --> 38:22.080
Guess what happened in the end.

38:23.640 --> 38:25.320
He killed the noblewoman.

38:26.240 --> 38:28.960
Duke Su, why do you enjoy
stories full of bloodshed so much?

38:29.520 --> 38:30.360
Could it be

38:32.760 --> 38:34.200
that they became lovebirds?

38:37.080 --> 38:38.160
Let's wait and see.

38:55.280 --> 38:58.640
I'll put on a good act for you.

39:15.840 --> 39:17.960
Why do you think
Jiang Li isn't participating?

39:18.440 --> 39:19.680
Didn't she want to seek guidance

39:19.760 --> 39:21.480
from Shen Yurong before?

39:22.520 --> 39:23.560
Why did you hit me?

39:23.640 --> 39:25.520
You fool. What else could it be?

39:25.600 --> 39:27.000
She must be feeling down.

39:27.080 --> 39:28.680
With so much going on
in your family lately

39:28.760 --> 39:29.920
and Tong'er gone,

39:30.000 --> 39:32.400
who would be in the mood to study
or seek guidance?

39:32.480 --> 39:34.800
People like them who love learning

39:34.880 --> 39:37.000
find it therapeutic.

39:37.080 --> 39:38.600
If you don't believe me, ask Ye Shijie.

39:40.760 --> 39:43.400
Since Jiang Li doesn't want to join,
let's not bring it up anymore.

39:43.480 --> 39:45.160
Let her have some peace and quiet.

39:45.240 --> 39:46.520
We shouldn't disturb her either.

39:46.600 --> 39:47.760
We can't do that.

39:48.240 --> 39:49.720
We can't leave her alone.

39:49.800 --> 39:51.320
Are you discussing the reception envoy?

39:52.800 --> 39:53.760
What is wrong with you?

39:53.840 --> 39:55.400
- You should've made some noise.
- Jiang Li.

39:55.480 --> 39:56.360
Where did…

39:58.920 --> 39:59.760
Shijie,

40:00.520 --> 40:03.880
did His Majesty ask Shen Yurong
to handle the reception envoys?

40:03.960 --> 40:04.880
Yes.

40:09.000 --> 40:09.840
I want to join.

40:11.520 --> 40:13.320
TO MR. SHEN

40:15.840 --> 40:18.400
SHEN RESIDENCE

40:35.160 --> 40:36.760
JIANG LI FROM THE SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY
REQUESTS TO JOIN THE RECEPTION ENVOY

40:36.840 --> 40:38.160
JIANG LI

40:41.880 --> 40:42.840
Yurong.

40:47.760 --> 40:50.400
Can I help
with welcoming the Great Zhao delegation?

40:51.960 --> 40:53.600
- Just leave it there.
- All right.

41:04.880 --> 41:06.360
TO MR. SHEN

41:08.680 --> 41:09.960
JIANG LI

41:29.120 --> 41:31.560
JIANG LI

41:33.640 --> 41:34.480
Yurong,

41:35.360 --> 41:38.320
how's the reception envoy
for Great Zhao going lately?

41:38.400 --> 41:39.280
It's all right.

41:39.360 --> 41:40.760
Your sister told me that

41:40.840 --> 41:43.640
many from the School of Integrity
submitted self-recommendation letters.

41:43.720 --> 41:45.640
Did Ms. Jiang Li also submit one?

41:48.200 --> 41:49.880
Listen to me.

41:49.960 --> 41:51.240
We're able

41:51.320 --> 41:53.840
to enjoy fine food

41:54.360 --> 41:56.120
and live a comfortable life

41:56.200 --> 41:58.080
all because of Her Highness.

41:58.880 --> 42:01.160
Before you do anything,

42:01.240 --> 42:03.360
remember not to upset Her Highness.

42:03.440 --> 42:04.680
Do you hear me?

42:04.760 --> 42:06.760
Her Highness.

42:07.360 --> 42:09.680
You always talk about Her Highness.

42:09.760 --> 42:13.160
Is the Shen family Her Highness's dog?

42:13.920 --> 42:15.720
What are you saying?

42:15.800 --> 42:17.680
Do you think everything we have now

42:17.760 --> 42:19.440
is given by Her Highness?

42:19.520 --> 42:20.840
What about my years

42:20.920 --> 42:23.680
of dedication
to the imperial court and His Majesty?

42:24.240 --> 42:25.600
The money we have

42:25.680 --> 42:27.920
for our family's daily expenses
is my hard-earned salary,

42:28.000 --> 42:29.360
not Her Highness' rewards!

42:29.840 --> 42:31.160
Mother is just concerned about you.

42:31.240 --> 42:33.640
She's afraid you'll make wrong decisions
and fall from grace again.

42:33.720 --> 42:36.240
You remind me day and night like this.

42:36.320 --> 42:39.960
How would I dare to make any mistakes?

42:46.280 --> 42:48.280
Yurong will surely
understand your intentions.

42:57.280 --> 42:59.040
The reception envoy
selection results are out.

42:59.120 --> 43:00.120
It's already out.

43:00.200 --> 43:01.120
Ye Shijie,

43:01.200 --> 43:03.240
Liu Xu's letter and mine were approved.

43:03.320 --> 43:04.760
The four of us can be together again.

43:05.320 --> 43:07.360
- What's wrong?
- Jiang Li didn't receive her letter.

43:07.880 --> 43:09.120
She didn't receive one?

43:09.200 --> 43:11.920
She's the most outstanding among us.
It's impossible not to be approved.

43:12.000 --> 43:12.960
You're so silly.

43:13.040 --> 43:15.160
He said she didn't receive it.

43:15.240 --> 43:16.840
Even if it's not approved,

43:16.920 --> 43:18.520
the letter would be returned.

43:18.600 --> 43:20.760
Could it be
that Jiang Li's letter is lost?

43:22.640 --> 43:23.680
It won't be lost.

43:24.320 --> 43:26.520
Mr. Shen probably has yet
to make up his mind.

43:26.600 --> 43:27.640
What do you mean?

43:28.400 --> 43:29.360
I need a favor from you.

43:29.440 --> 43:30.440
What do you need me to do?

43:31.000 --> 43:32.520
I want him to come to the residence

43:33.120 --> 43:34.120
and personally invite me.

43:40.440 --> 43:41.360
Your Majesty,

43:41.440 --> 43:44.400
the schedule for the delegation's
reception has been completed.

43:44.480 --> 43:45.440
For the details,

43:45.520 --> 43:47.440
I've requested the Ministry of Revenue's
Vice Director Ye Shijie to draft it

43:47.520 --> 43:48.800
into a document.

43:48.880 --> 43:50.080
Please review it, Your Majesty.

43:51.200 --> 43:53.560
- I'll take my leave now.
- All right.

43:53.640 --> 43:54.480
Your Majesty,

43:54.960 --> 43:56.160
I'd like to suggest that

43:56.800 --> 43:59.280
Ms. Jiang Li perform
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms."

43:59.360 --> 44:01.200
This song is well-known.

44:01.280 --> 44:03.200
If she is selected
to join the reception envoy

44:03.280 --> 44:06.040
and perform at the alliance banquet
for the Great Zhao delegation,

44:06.600 --> 44:07.800
it will surely impress them

44:07.880 --> 44:10.000
and make their visit enjoyable.

44:10.080 --> 44:12.120
I've heard Mian Ju
mention this several times.

44:12.680 --> 44:16.800
He has always praised Jiang Li's
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms."

44:17.480 --> 44:18.840
I wanted her to perform it

44:18.920 --> 44:20.680
at the palace banquet before.

44:20.760 --> 44:22.680
But I had state affairs to attend to

44:22.760 --> 44:23.600
and left early.

44:23.680 --> 44:26.400
During the Annual Exam,
you were also present, Minister Shen.

44:26.480 --> 44:27.360
What do you think?

44:28.520 --> 44:29.360
Your Majesty,

44:30.120 --> 44:31.320
it's indeed an excellent piece.

44:32.360 --> 44:33.680
Ms. Jiang Li is not included

44:33.760 --> 44:34.880
in the reception envoy.

44:34.960 --> 44:36.600
Did she not submit
a recommendation letter?

44:36.680 --> 44:38.680
She did submit one.

44:39.520 --> 44:40.480
But considering

44:40.560 --> 44:42.280
the recent events in the Jiang family,

44:42.360 --> 44:43.680
I haven't approved it yet.

44:45.000 --> 44:47.800
Do you also think an evil spirit
possessed Ms. Jiang Li?

44:49.680 --> 44:51.800
I am aware
of the Jiang family's situation.

44:51.880 --> 44:55.080
However, supernatural matters
aren't appropriate for open discussion.

44:55.160 --> 44:57.840
Minister Shen, you're being narrow-minded.

44:57.920 --> 44:58.760
I apologize.

45:01.840 --> 45:05.160
Vice Director Ye, I will approve
Ms. Jiang Li's letter right away.

45:05.240 --> 45:06.320
You are her cousin.

45:06.920 --> 45:08.600
You can pass it on to her.

45:08.680 --> 45:09.520
Mr. Shen.

45:10.040 --> 45:12.560
This is an official matter.
It'd be improper for me to pass it on.

45:12.640 --> 45:15.240
Besides, since you didn't approve
her letter before,

45:15.320 --> 45:16.880
Ms. Jiang Li might have misunderstood.

45:17.640 --> 45:18.640
If you don't go,

45:19.480 --> 45:20.840
how can I explain it clearly?

45:35.720 --> 45:38.000
My lady, you're truly insightful.

45:38.080 --> 45:39.720
Mr. Shen has indeed come to see you.

45:39.800 --> 45:40.880
He's outside right now.

45:45.000 --> 45:46.640
With the alliance meeting approaching,

45:46.720 --> 45:48.240
how do you have the time to visit me?

45:50.360 --> 45:53.680
I have a request today.

45:53.760 --> 45:55.520
In today's meeting
about the alliance banquet,

45:56.080 --> 45:59.960
His Majesty mentioned
he wanted to hear you play

46:00.040 --> 46:02.040
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms."

46:02.600 --> 46:03.880
I played it once

46:03.960 --> 46:06.720
at the Annual Exam
at the School of Integrity.

46:06.800 --> 46:09.040
I didn't expect His Majesty
to hold it in such high regard.

46:09.600 --> 46:11.200
Your great guqin skills are renowned

46:11.680 --> 46:13.000
throughout the capital.

46:13.560 --> 46:14.840
With such fame,

46:14.920 --> 46:16.720
people are bound to talk about it.

46:16.800 --> 46:18.440
It might be best for you to stay low-key.

46:18.520 --> 46:21.320
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms"
has a sorrowful melody.

46:21.400 --> 46:23.880
With the Great Zhao delegation
coming for the alliance meeting,

46:23.960 --> 46:25.840
playing this might be inappropriate.

46:25.920 --> 46:29.160
So I wish to ask you
to appeal to His Majesty

46:29.240 --> 46:30.480
to decline this performance.

46:31.080 --> 46:34.480
Stir with emotions and convince
with sound reasoning.

46:35.280 --> 46:37.680
Those who don't know better

46:37.760 --> 46:40.720
would think you're very considerate of me,
making profound plans for me.

46:41.680 --> 46:45.160
I just think you can see
the bigger picture,

46:45.920 --> 46:47.600
which is why I came to seek your help.

46:47.680 --> 46:49.360
If you're unwilling,

46:49.440 --> 46:51.040
I will inform His Majesty

46:51.120 --> 46:52.480
of your resignation from this task.

46:54.120 --> 46:55.200
Sorry for the trouble today.

46:56.240 --> 46:57.080
I'll take my leave.

46:57.160 --> 46:59.280
BLISSFUL FAMILY AND PROSPEROUS CAREER

46:59.360 --> 47:00.320
Mr. Shen,

47:01.920 --> 47:02.920
what are you afraid of?

47:07.280 --> 47:09.080
Ms. Jiang Li, what do you mean by that?

47:09.160 --> 47:12.240
If you don't want me
to join the reception envoy,

47:12.320 --> 47:13.840
you could have just rejected my letter.

47:14.400 --> 47:16.720
But you didn't reject it or approve it.

47:16.800 --> 47:19.160
You hesitated.

47:19.720 --> 47:20.760
You should know

47:21.360 --> 47:22.640
what I am hesitating about.

47:22.720 --> 47:24.760
After all,
your intentions are too obvious.

47:24.840 --> 47:26.040
My intentions?

47:26.120 --> 47:28.080
Have you misunderstood something?

47:28.160 --> 47:29.520
You can fool others,

47:29.600 --> 47:30.600
but not me.

47:30.680 --> 47:33.200
Mr. Shen.

47:33.280 --> 47:35.280
Should I call you foolish

47:35.360 --> 47:36.960
or do you flatter yourself?

47:37.600 --> 47:38.720
It seems like

47:39.600 --> 47:41.760
you still see me as your late wife.

47:43.000 --> 47:44.480
Since you're so certain,

47:44.560 --> 47:46.080
why did you oppose Her Highness

47:46.160 --> 47:47.360
before His Majesty?

47:49.640 --> 47:51.360
You should know best

47:52.480 --> 47:53.400
that I

47:54.640 --> 47:58.240
am the daughter of the Chief Secretariat
and Grand Preceptor,

47:59.320 --> 48:01.520
not your infamous late wife.

48:01.600 --> 48:03.360
Even if I do look like her,

48:03.440 --> 48:04.440
so what?

48:05.240 --> 48:06.360
In that case,

48:08.000 --> 48:10.640
why do you insist on joining
the reception envoy I manage?

48:10.720 --> 48:13.360
My maid died protecting me.

48:14.440 --> 48:15.760
She was like a sister to me.

48:16.440 --> 48:18.360
I am sad and heartbroken.

48:18.440 --> 48:19.920
I have been in despair for days.

48:20.000 --> 48:23.400
I just want to enjoy the lively atmosphere
of the alliance meeting.

48:23.960 --> 48:24.840
Is that wrong?

48:24.920 --> 48:28.120
If you insist on rejecting my letter,

48:28.640 --> 48:30.800
please do not impose your feelings

48:30.880 --> 48:32.040
for your late wife on me.

48:32.600 --> 48:35.000
Instead, find a more convincing reason.

48:35.840 --> 48:37.080
Otherwise, people might think

48:37.760 --> 48:39.640
you have a guilty conscience.

48:43.880 --> 48:46.440
You should leave now, Mr. Shen.

49:42.120 --> 49:42.960
Son.

49:43.480 --> 49:45.040
Listen to me.

49:45.680 --> 49:46.880
We're able

49:46.960 --> 49:49.560
to enjoy fine food

49:49.640 --> 49:51.560
and live a comfortable life

49:51.640 --> 49:53.640
all because of Her Highness.

49:53.720 --> 49:56.040
The way you talk is heartbreaking.

49:56.760 --> 49:59.240
It's a pity I can't adore you
during this time.

50:00.360 --> 50:02.360
My maid died protecting me.

50:03.160 --> 50:04.520
She was like a sister to me.

50:05.000 --> 50:08.080
I just want to enjoy the lively atmosphere
of the alliance meeting.
